fect and we got disconnected few times but by the end of the night we had played some 7 hours and got 2 more friends to buy and play with us.  it is rough around the edges but the base is there and fast pew pew fun with the ability to get lucky and make totally broke builds with friends is totally fun.", "timestamp_created": 1701356421, "timestamp_updated": 1701356421, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152568167", "author": {"steamid": "76561198245218412", "personaname": "ThaiGrr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198245218412/", "num_games_owned": 78, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 3507, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2167, "last_played": 1721962914, "avatar": "4be3d7b8b982c018ae8356bff74199378f02c037"}, "language": "english", "review": "Mess with the Crabo, you get the stabo", "timestamp_created": 1701333855, "timestamp_updated": 1701333855, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152566033", "author": {"steamid": "76561197970430737", "personaname": "Eocene", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197970430737/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 139, "playtime_forever": 518, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 117, "last_played": 1779894670, "avatar": "c4741db01a41425ba8e9246a2f9a18a6e133c5a2"}, "language": "english", "review": "While still in early access (meaning a lot of planned content isn't available yet), it does everything right so far. It's a small download, starts up very quickly, runs smoothly, looks polished, controls intuitively, has an excellent soundtrack by NoiseStorm (who did the Crab Rave track years ago, the inspiration for this game), and is just heaps of fun to play with friends. It's got deep and well-developed roguelite mechanics as well, with firepower often building up to ludicrous levels over the course of a run. It's a very loveable package all around, and comes highly recommended!", "timestamp_created": 1701329910, "timestamp_updated": 1701329910, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.543379008769989014", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152566008", "author": {"steamid": "76561198851638444", "personaname": "Walking Cushion", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198851638444/", "num_games_owned": 62, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 849, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 746, "last_played": 1754111076, "avatar": "a3cc745272d0f9f8701992f6c89a0f801a8997d0"}, "language": "english", "review": "i have crabs now", "timestamp_created": 1701329863, "timestamp_updated": 1701329863, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "152564573", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045127563", "personaname": "Hyperbeam", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198045127563/", "num_games_owned": 173, "num_reviews": 6, "playt